# Ghitu Lavarunner (1/2) with nothing in the graveyard is a 1/2. A second Lavarunner is cast and killed by Lightning Bolt:
# the graveyard then holds one instant and one creature card, and the creature does not count as an instant or sorcery
# (one is not two), so the first stays 1/2. Chain Lightning (sorcery) makes two instant/sorcery cards: it is 2/2 with haste
# (CR 604.1, 611.3a).

